description:
Develop a module that converts a 4-bit binary input into a 4-bit Gray code output. The conversion is triggered on the rising edge of the clock signal, with the least significant bit of the output directly reflecting the input, while the subsequent bits are calculated using the XOR operation on adjacent bits of the binary input.
module top_module(
  input [3:0] B,
  input Clk,
  output reg [3:0] G
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [3:0] B,
  input Clk,
  output reg [3:0] G
);always @(posedge Clk) begin
  G[0] = B[0];
  G[1] = B[0] ^ B[1];
  G[2] = B[1] ^ B[2];
  G[3] = B[2] ^ B[3];
end

endmodule

